A web crawler

The `Frontier` gives URLs to the `Fetcher`, with the label `urls`. The
`Fetcher` fetches pages from the `Web` with the label `download`, and passes
them to the `Parser` with the label `pages`. The `Parser` adds URLs to the
`Frontier` with the label `new urls`, and stores to the `Index` with the label
`text`.
---
Frontier -> Fetcher: urls
Fetcher -> Web: download
Fetcher -> Parser: pages
Parser -> Frontier: new urls
Parser -> Index: text
